</td><td valign="top" align="center" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: center;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_0a6da9a5-8853-c983-2cee-8a74d7f1ad7b" id="_0a6da9a5-8853-c983-2cee-8a74d7f1ad7b"></a>1</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_dc162c1c-7f03-054b-08fd-2ce53796ea22" id="_dc162c1c-7f03-054b-08fd-2ce53796ea22"></a>Enumeration</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d13aa824-9dd9-3362-e5d4-9259d4f14f3e" id="_d13aa824-9dd9-3362-e5d4-9259d4f14f3e"></a>Mandatory in S-102.<br/> The only allowed value is 2:  <i>verticalDatum</i><br/> (see  <a href="#iho-s100">S-100, Part 10c, Table 22</a>).</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_92871b87-ad2c-ad0d-2452-81f70cc7af53" id="_92871b87-ad2c-ad0d-2452-81f70cc7af53"></a>10</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_60c73141-5bea-a484-7c2a-1a22da34dff4" id="_60c73141-5bea-a484-7c2a-1a22da34dff4"></a>Vertical datum reference</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_f0a9b6c7-85f1-61ea-20e6-0ae0cb719c35" id="_f0a9b6c7-85f1-61ea-20e6-0ae0cb719c35"></a>verticalDatumReference</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="center" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: center;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_af65c142-c28c-748f-f879-a09c1db50411" id="_af65c142-c28c-748f-f879-a09c1db50411"></a>1</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_75329187-b46e-b943-8f87-81665e4f5bae" id="_75329187-b46e-b943-8f87-81665e4f5bae"></a>Enumeration</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b01ef84f-9c21-2903-c3da-8a02ae021545" id="_b01ef84f-9c21-2903-c3da-8a02ae021545"></a>Mandatory in S-102.<br/> The only allowed value is 1: s100VerticalDatum <br/> (see  <a href="#iho-s100">S-100, Part 10c, Table 23</a>).</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_fe0582b8-7b29-e948-5937-ec7a85775741" id="_fe0582b8-7b29-e948-5937-ec7a85775741"></a>11</p>
