</div>
</div>
      <div><a name="_md_maintenanceinformation" id="_md_maintenanceinformation"></a><h2>12.6<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>MD_MaintenanceInformation</h2>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_169e4bf4-6b86-fc0c-1836-15b1c2dba480" id="_169e4bf4-6b86-fc0c-1836-15b1c2dba480"></a>S-102 uses MD_MaintenanceInformation without modification.</p>
