<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_87e6d319-e82d-2f32-9d70-c043f3282f54" id="_87e6d319-e82d-2f32-9d70-c043f3282f54"></a>S-102 uses MD_MaintenanceFrequencyCode without modification.</p>
