        <div><a name="_feature_attributes" id="_feature_attributes"></a><h2>A.2<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Feature Attributes</h2>

<div><a name="_bathymetrycoverage_3" id="_bathymetrycoverage_3"></a><h3>A.2.1<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>BathymetryCoverage</h3>

<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table A-3&#xA0;&#x2014; BathymetryCoverage feature attribute parameters</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_6e9dc1cb-66d0-21b7-4e48-87c414be2317" id="_6e9dc1cb-66d0-21b7-4e48-87c414be2317"></a><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_ff915230-14c5-58b7-47c6-f2687f692fbf" id="_ff915230-14c5-58b7-47c6-f2687f692fbf"></a>IHO Definition: <b>depth</b>. The vertical distance from a given water level to the bottom [<a href="#iho-s32">S-32</a>].</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_3c07ce42-1091-c7a6-00af-fb4d6b35dcc7" id="_3c07ce42-1091-c7a6-00af-fb4d6b35dcc7"></a>Unit: metres</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_8d96617a-9d64-fe25-fc06-5dede8e07bcd" id="_8d96617a-9d64-fe25-fc06-5dede8e07bcd"></a>Resolution: 0.01</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_5f4d15b9-209c-442a-256f-73dab4f82855" id="_5f4d15b9-209c-442a-256f-73dab4f82855"></a>Remarks:</p>

<div class="ul_wrap" style="page-break-after:avoid"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo12;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Drying heights (drying depths) are indicated by a negative value.
</p>
</div>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9e68df7f-6598-8398-1037-fc05c8d232da" id="_9e68df7f-6598-8398-1037-fc05c8d232da"></a>IHO Definition: <b>uncertainty</b>. Estimate characterising the range of values within which the true value of a measurement is expected to lie as defined within a particular confidence level. It is expressed as a positive value.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_eab97480-d2af-5e11-22dd-116c40b01414" id="_eab97480-d2af-5e11-22dd-116c40b01414"></a>Unit: metres</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_9965e117-4e80-dce2-6710-07059349677d" id="_9965e117-4e80-dce2-6710-07059349677d"></a>Resolution: 0.01</p>
</td></tr><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_98f17ccb-5549-f93f-3170-59af6871dba3" id="_98f17ccb-5549-f93f-3170-59af6871dba3"></a>Remarks:</p>

<div class="ul_wrap" style="page-break-after:auto"><p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo13;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">Represents a +/- value defining the possible range of associated depth.
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo13;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">Expressed as a positive number.
</p>
</div>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</div>

<div><a name="_qualityofbathymetrycoverage_3" id="_qualityofbathymetrycoverage_3"></a><h3>A.2.2<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>QualityOfBathymetryCoverage</h3>

<p class="TableTitle" style="text-align:center;">Table A-4&#xA0;&#x2014; QualityOfBathymetryCoverage feature attribute parameters</p><div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_b5ffc2dd-e47a-1531-bae8-55309140cb58" id="_b5ffc2dd-e47a-1531-bae8-55309140cb58"></a><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:avoid" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b1f96a02-9a6f-543b-e453-6c736ce2a9ac" id="_b1f96a02-9a6f-543b-e453-6c736ce2a9ac"></a>IHO Definition: <b>iD</b>. Meta data record identifier for QualityOfBathymetryCoverage</p>
